    'Because costs usually rise, FIFO shows the highest profit and the most valuable inventory, LIFO the lowest profit and the lowest tax, and weighted average sits between them. This page uses the periodic method: one calculation for the period, which is what the IRS and most small-business accounting software do at year end.',

